    "name": "Usage API 📊📊📊",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": "- Endpoint: `GET /usagev2/api.{json|xml}?KEY=YOUR_KEY`\n- Credits: no API credits used.\n- Purpose: quick credit balance check.\n\nExample JSON response:\n```json\n{\n  \"used\": 1234,\n  \"purchased\": 200000,\n  \"remaining\": 198766\n}\n```\n\nUpdated 2026-11-10 from https://api.builtwith.com/llms-full.txt. Set KEY locally. Requests are examples; sending data requests may consume credits. Optional query parameters are disabled until selected."
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Get Credit Balance",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "https://api.builtwith.com/usagev2/api.json?KEY={{KEY}}",
          "protocol": "https",
          "host": [
            "api",
            "builtwith",
            "com"
          ],
          "path": [
            "usagev2",
            "api.json"
          ],
          "query": [
            {
              "key": "KEY",
              "value": "{{KEY}}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "description": "",
        "auth": {
          "type": "noauth"
        }
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "Other Formats",
